-- docs/plans/game-card/assets/25-clean-logos/clean_team_logos.py, and passed two separate checks. They are already in
-- Storage beside the old files, which stay, so a wrong one goes back by its old address (that folder's
-- raw/move_team_logos_back.sql). Six teams keep their file (ROCORI, Albany, St. Catherine, Lake Forest, Cristo Rey,
-- Waconia: game-card 27). A row moves only while it still holds the address the clean-up read, so a logo the morning
-- changed since is left alone. colors and everything else stay.
